The  driver provides support for integrated graphics functions in
Intel chipsets and provides an interface for the machine indepen‐
dent driver.  Currently configures the display for the integrated
panel in notebooks and can control the backlight.  Automatic  de‐
tection  of  the  main display on desktop machines may or may not
work.  Supported hardware includes: GMA 900 (915G) GMA 950 (945G)
GMA 3000 (Q965) GMA X3000 (G965) GMA X3500 (G35) GMA X4500  (G45)
HD (Westmere) HD2000/3000 (Sandy Bridge) HD2500/4000 (Ivy Bridge)
